OL,3,AClaude chatbot maker set for $1.3tn
OL,4,Astock market debut despite
OL,5,A'catastrophic' AI warning
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic, the artificial intelligence
OL,8,F(AI) company behind the Claude chatbot,
OL,9,Fcould be valued at around $1.3 trillion
OL,10,F(#1 trillion) when it lists its shares
OL,11,Ffor sale on New York's Nasdaq stock
OL,12,Fexchange.
OL,14,FThe loss-making company says it will
OL,15,Foffer its shares for between $70 and
OL,16,F$78 each and will raise up to $64bn
OL,17,Fwhen it floats this month.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,118,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11702
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F117A1794534867
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AClaude chatbot maker set for $1.3tn
OL,4,Astock market debut despite
OL,5,A'catastrophic' AI warning
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt would value Anthropic at between
OL,8,F$1.1tn and $1.3tn which, although
OL,9,Flarge, is below the $2tn some backers
OL,10,Fof the firm predicted in summer,
OL,11,Faccording to the Financial Times.
OL,13,FThe huge valuation comes despite the
OL,14,Fcompany warning last month that AI
OL,15,Fcould pose "catastrophic or existential
OL,16,Frisks to humanity".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
